### 7.1 Config — add `wildcard_url` per plane

**Today** (`config.go`):

```go
type PlaneConfig struct {
	ID              string `yaml:"id"`
	URL             string `yaml:"url"`
	OwnerToken      string `yaml:"owner_token"`
	DefaultTemplate string `yaml:"default_template"`
}
```

**Change to:**

```go
type PlaneConfig struct {
	ID              string `yaml:"id"`
	URL             string `yaml:"url"`
	WildcardURL     string `yaml:"wildcard_url"` // e.g. "https://*.coder-a.example.com"
	OwnerToken      string `yaml:"owner_token"`
	DefaultTemplate string `yaml:"default_template"`
}
```

Mirror on runtime `Plane` in `planes.go` when planes are loaded from config (same field).

**YAML:**

```yaml
planes:
  - id: a
    url: "https://coder-a.example.com"
    wildcard_url: "https://*.coder-a.example.com"
    owner_token: "…"
    default_template: "multiplane-apps"
```
